-`results/perf/be6f466.csv` vs `931741d.csv`). Remaining limiter in `sa_core`:
-the accumulator BRAM → STORE data output. Most of `sa_top`'s CCU2C are the six
-48-bit performance counters and the DMA address arithmetic.
